{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"57d1175e38860070653fe11fd2e8736d9496355bd86288bc056aafd434fdfd1c","ja":"こうなったら","zh":"既然都这样了","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6b611ec018509a6a1d4ec0af17ec2ede2ddf4adf91581e1454f3853e3c41ef40","ja":"やっぱりここは、新しい律っちゃんの姿を\n見せるべきだよ！","zh":"这种时候果然还是应该展现出\n小律子全新的一面才对！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"12f14aaf238510ff2a3afd67c0e4a95dd4ab6e84dd8145ef762dbf1eafca1a83","ja":"ミキ的には、律子、さんは、\nギラギラしたイメージが良いって思うな。","zh":"美希觉得，律子的话，\n还是闪闪发光的感觉更好呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d1163937a6c99f6410a19e97e461ae244e30676f7f1e2c240db3e4289b6f02e6","ja":"え～っと……私は優しい方がいいと思うけど、\nみんなのもいいな～って思うし、うーん……。","zh":"那个……虽然我觉得温柔的比较好，\n但也觉得大家的都很棒呢，嗯……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7f2b96fe84a9018c076727cb03e386b48ba98e2c86baaf9cc072a4c933458b5a","ja":"ちょ、ちょっと、あんたたち。\n最後に決めるのは私なんだから、そんなに……。","zh":"等、等等，你们几个。\n最后拿主意的人可是我，不用那么……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"5f2967efffb82b9048129504fad174d1f41e7901163fe1d2c2e776cc8fcbf7d1","ja":"こうなったら、亜美たちで律っちゃんに\n着せたい服を選んじゃおうよ！","zh":"既然这样，不如就由亚美她们来选\n想让律子穿的衣服吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"6be7e8de2ce4d20be280be7bdaddc2cf9443c45b76e6ba5d4d3ace961136db8b","ja":"んで、誰のが一番いいか決めればいいんだよ！","zh":"然后，只要决定谁的最好就行了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"79c2d3e1cbdd76104bce20a5e3e281876b172441fb423eae33511cc510efcb0e","ja":"あはっ☆　面白そうなの♪\nミキ、律子、さんにいろんな服、着てほしいな。","zh":"啊哈☆　好像很有趣呢♪\n美希很想看律子穿各种各样的衣服呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"fa6e755eece4e1d0bc65ece0c174382ad2cb48353f62872fc90b5dbf8cc0d56e","ja":"真美も真美もっ！\nあ～んな服とか、こ～んな服とかっ♪","zh":"真美也要真美也要！\n穿那～样的衣服，或是这～样的衣服♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"3aba8f32e0406577ee9d62b7ab7c12de931696ab62c0d499b7464ed0a16e48bd","ja":"うっうー！　それじゃあ今から、\nお洋服屋さんに行きましょ～！","zh":"呜——！那么现在就去\n服装店吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"96990986aad20408df0cfa2aa7ae7d260085c1ce4c3f128d265eebd3ccf4ce38","ja":"んっふっふ～。亜美のファッションセンスの\n見せどころですな～。","zh":"嗯哼哼～。正该好好展现一下\n亚美的时尚品味了呢～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"3d6478398291cccc3e7ff7cdab43003c8a05a8cb5e7f20d798d2b6f8b0f55e10","ja":"まったくもう。\nすぐにそういうことをしようとするんだから……。","zh":"真是的。\n总是想做这种事……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"0f99f3ead040172f24c6d6d904e9b52e17ad780135a67d3e0747c0223d3b6101","ja":"でも、私のことをいろいろ考えてくれての\n行動なのよね……。","zh":"不过，这也是替我考虑了许多\n才做出的行动呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1382.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"8098663cb134d1b002636b8362a6147a84964acbcaaa92706f2a75089dfa82ee","ja":"こうなったら、完全にお任せにするわ！　その代わり、\nしっかりプレゼンしてよね！　期待してるわよ！","zh":"既然都这样了，那就全都交给你了！作为交换，\n你可要好好展示一番哦！我很期待呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
